  "body": "Commanding approximately 4,045m² of prime waterfront land, this exceptional estate delivers a level of space, privacy and lifestyle rarely found in Auckland. Beyond the secure gated entrance lies an impressive residence of approximately 720m², surrounded by established grounds and framed by magnificent coastal views.\r\n\r\nCreated for families who appreciate space on a grand scale, the home offers five generous double bedrooms and five bathrooms, along with an extraordinary selection of living and entertaining areas. Formal and casual lounges, a spacious family room, rumpus room and dedicated office provide the flexibility to accommodate everyday family life, visiting guests and special occasions with ease.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen sits at the centre of the home, flowing naturally into the dining and living spaces while connecting with the expansive outdoor areas. Large windows invite abundant natural light and allow the ever-changing waterfront outlook to become part of the interior.\r\n\r\nStep outside and the property reveals its true sense of occasion. The swimming pool and spa create the perfect setting for relaxed summer days, while the full-sized tennis court, private gym, sauna and children's playground offer recreation for every generation. Generous lawns, patios and sheltered entertaining areas provide countless options for gatherings, celebrations or quiet moments in complete privacy.\r\n\r\nFrom the grounds, direct access to the water invites you to launch a kayak, explore the coastline or begin the day beside the sea. Few properties offer such an immediate connection to the waterfront while retaining this amount of usable land and seclusion. The substantial layout also provides excellent flexibility for extended or multigenerational families, including separate guest accommodation. A triple internal-access garage and extensive off-street parking provide abundant room for vehicles, boats and recreational equipment, while central air conditioning and gas heating ensure comfort throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nAll of this is within easy reach of Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry services, cafés, restaurants, shopping and well-regarded local schools. This is more than an impressive waterfront home. It is a private estate of extraordinary scale, created to be enjoyed today and held for generations.",
